      "description": "Hainbach’s Spotykach Tapes\n\nThis pack is straight from the cutting room of the past three years of my explorations. For every video I make, I spend hours making sample packs for my https://patreon.com/hainbach, and this pack I curated for Spotykach is a selection from the thousands of sounds there. You will find strange resonances from ancient speakers, pumping nuclear research equipment, esoteric oscillations, acoustic loops, tape squeals, early digital glitter, whimsical melodies, dark drones and much here. Its meant to be a little treasure chest for you to explore and find inspiration in. Happy stumbling!\n\nHainbach, Berlin, 19.04.2026",
